    <title>Typography in space</title>
    <link href="https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/" />
    <updated>2025-06-21T09:51:00Z</updated>
    <id>https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/</id>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;I&#39;ve been going down the rabbit hole of the NASA photo archives on
archive.org and enjoyed these two photos showcasing the use of Helvetica
on the Atlantis space shuttle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;picture&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/avif&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/FzT30rYKRN-3032.avif 3032w&quot;&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/webp&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/FzT30rYKRN-3032.webp 3032w&quot;&gt;&lt;img loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; src=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/FzT30rYKRN-3032.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;Typography on Atlantis shuttle in orbit, 2002&quot; width=&quot;3032&quot; height=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Typography on Atlantis shuttle in orbit, 2002. Source: &lt;a href=&quot;https://archive.org/details/iss005e17705&quot;&gt;Internet Archive&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;picture&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/avif&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/abIveiBWHH-3032.avif 3032w&quot;&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/webp&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/abIveiBWHH-3032.webp 3032w&quot;&gt;&lt;img loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; src=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/abIveiBWHH-3032.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;Typography on Atlantis shuttle wing, 2002&quot; width=&quot;3032&quot; height=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Typography on Atlantis shuttle wing, 2002. Source: &lt;a href=&quot;https://archive.org/details/iss005e17718&quot;&gt;Internet Archive&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There&#39;s more detail on NASA&#39;s design and typography guidance in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/nasa_graphics_manual_nhb_1430-2_jan_1976.pdf&quot;&gt;this 1976 design manual&lt;/a&gt;
which includes 	examples for spacecraft markings (p.56).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;picture&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/avif&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/b_loBQTacs-1920.avif 1920w&quot;&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/webp&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/b_loBQTacs-1920.webp 1920w&quot;&gt;&lt;img loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; src=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-06-21-typography-in-space-1/b_loBQTacs-1920.png&quot; alt=&quot;Space shuttle markings page, NASA design guide 1976&quot; width=&quot;1920&quot; height=&quot;1080&quot;&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Space shuttle markings page, NASA design guide 1976. Source: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/nasa_graphics_manual_nhb_1430-2_jan_1976.pdf&quot;&gt;NASA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>Humanitarian climate whitewashing</title>
    <link href="https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-05-19-humanitarian-climate-whitewash/" />
    <updated>2025-05-19T13:50:00Z</updated>
    <id>https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-05-19-humanitarian-climate-whitewash/</id>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Irwin Loy, writing for The New Humanitarian, highlights the trend of humanitarian organisations removing references to climate change
from their websites:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thenewhumanitarian.org/news/2025/04/24/aid-groups-are-erasing-climate-change-their-websites&quot;&gt;Aid groups are erasing climate change from their websites&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Feeling Trump pressure, some agencies are editing, downplaying, or deleting climate language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;He also notes organisations removing reference to &#39;gender equality&#39;.&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>Geospatial cryptic crossword</title>
    <link href="https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-05-16-geospatial-cryptic-crossword/" />
    <updated>2025-05-16T17:20:00Z</updated>
    <id>https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-05-16-geospatial-cryptic-crossword/</id>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mapstodon.space/@geospacedman@mastodon.social&quot;&gt;Barry Rowlingson&lt;/a&gt; shared a &lt;a href=&quot;https://b-rowlingson.gitlab.io/geocrossword/&quot;&gt;geospatial-themed cryptic crossword&lt;/a&gt;
in the newsletter of the Lancaster Data Science Institute&#39;s Geospatial group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;picture&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/avif&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-05-16-geospatial-cryptic-crossword/JeWlVdmk-Y-1476.avif 1476w&quot;&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/webp&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-05-16-geospatial-cryptic-crossword/JeWlVdmk-Y-1476.webp 1476w&quot;&gt;&lt;img loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; src=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-05-16-geospatial-cryptic-crossword/JeWlVdmk-Y-1476.png&quot; alt=&quot;geospatial crossword&quot; width=&quot;1476&quot; height=&quot;377&quot;&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I enjoyed completing it - the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/viresh-ratnakar/exet&quot;&gt;Exet&lt;/a&gt; web app for building and sharing the crossword is neat too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Barry shared the answers in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://wp.lancs.ac.uk/geospatial/2025/05/09/dsi-geospatial-april-may/&quot;&gt;April/May DSI Geospatial newsletter&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
