    <title>John Snow cholera map wall art</title>
    <link href="https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-03-21-john-snow-cholera-map-3d-print/" />
    <updated>2025-03-21T12:54:00Z</updated>
    <id>https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-03-21-john-snow-cholera-map-3d-print/</id>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Another post on a link I saved browsing 30daymapchallenge submissions on the Datawrapper blog: &lt;a href=&quot;https://bsky.app/profile/alexselbyb.bsky.social&quot;&gt;Alex Selby-Boothroyd&lt;/a&gt;&#39;s 3d-printed recreation of the famous John Snow cholera map. It looks way better than I&#39;d have thought if you&#39;d just described it to me.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;@alexselbyb.bsky.social: &lt;a href=&quot;https://bsky.app/profile/alexselbyb.bsky.social/post/3lba4wzj3i22i&quot;&gt;Day 18 #30DayMapChallenge. I 3D-printed John Snow&#39;s 1854 cholera map of Soho. It took ages.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;picture&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/avif&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-03-21-john-snow-cholera-map-3d-print/ZHwRh9WU6O-2000.avif 2000w&quot;&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/webp&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-03-21-john-snow-cholera-map-3d-print/ZHwRh9WU6O-2000.webp 2000w&quot;&gt;&lt;img loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; src=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-03-21-john-snow-cholera-map-3d-print/ZHwRh9WU6O-2000.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;3D model of John Snow&#39;s cholera map&quot; width=&quot;2000&quot; height=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;picture&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/avif&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-03-21-john-snow-cholera-map-3d-print/5JycQ6uM33-2000.avif 2000w&quot;&gt;&lt;source type=&quot;image/webp&quot; srcset=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-03-21-john-snow-cholera-map-3d-print/5JycQ6uM33-2000.webp 2000w&quot;&gt;&lt;img loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; src=&quot;https://parallels.lat/blog/2025-03-21-john-snow-cholera-map-3d-print/5JycQ6uM33-2000.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;3D print of John Snow&#39;s cholera map&quot; width=&quot;2000&quot; height=&quot;1126&quot;&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
